insert into public.problems (id, title, source, url, difficulty_rating, statement_md, input_format_md, output_format_md, constraints_text, sample_io, target_complexity) values ('uva-10814', 'Simplify', 'UVA', 'https://vjudge.net/problem/UVA-10814', 1500, '10814         Simplifying Fractions
You are to write a program that reduces a fraction into its lowest terms.

Input
The first line of the input file gives the number of test cases N (≤ 20). Each of the following N lines
contains a fraction in the form of p/q (1 ≤ p, q ≤ 1030 ).

Output
For each test case, output the fraction after simplification.

Sample Input
4
1 / 2
2 / 4
3 / 3
4 / 2

Sample Output
1 / 2
1 / 2
1 / 1
2 / 1

_Source: PDF text extraction — figures/diagrams may be missing; verify against the original._', 'The first line of the input file gives the number of test cases N (≤ 20). Each of the following N lines
contains a fraction in the form of p/q (1 ≤ p, q ≤ 1030 ).', 'For each test case, output the fraction after simplification.', '(≤ 20) (1 ≤ p, q ≤ 1030 )', '[{"input":"The first line of the input file gives the number of test cases N (≤ 20). Each of the following N lines\ncontains a fraction in the form of p/q (1 ≤ p, q ≤ 1030 ).","output":"For each test case, output the fraction after simplification."}]'::jsonb, 'O(N log N)');
